.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"functions-graphs","needsOriginal":false},{"id":"115-math-c-10","year":115,"exam":"math-c","subjectName":"數學(C)","questionNo":10,"answer":"B","excerpt":"若實數x滿足log x+log 8−(log x)(log 2)=2,則x=? 2 2 2 2","options":{"A":"– 2 1","B":"4","C":"2","D":"4"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"corruptedOcr":false,"originalPage":4,"groupId":null,"groupTitle":null,"passage":null,"sourceLabel":"115 年統測 · 數學(C)","lessonRoute":"/subjects/math-c/exponents-logarithms","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/115_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"exponents-logarithms","needsOriginal":false},{"id":"115-math-c-11","year":115,"exam":"math-c","subjectName":"數學(C)","questionNo":11,"answer":"D","excerpt":"某社群平台的帳號數量 N 與此平台上線的時間 t ( 單位:天 ) 的關係為N(t)=20262 0.5 t ,則下列敘述何者正確?","options":{"A":"帳號數量隨時間呈現線性成長","B":"帳號數量每天增加2026個","C":"當t=0時帳號數量為0","D":"帳號數量每2天增加一倍 x2 −2x−2 A Bx+C"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"corruptedOcr":false,"originalPage":4,"groupId":null,"groupTitle":null,"passage":null,"sourceLabel":"115 年統測 · 數學(C)","lessonRoute":"/subjects/math-c/exponents-logarithms","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/115_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"exponents-logarithms","teaching":{"questionId":"115-math-c-11","routes":["/subjects/math-c/exponents-logarithms"],"kind":"指數成長的倍率與倍增時間","knowledge":[["固定倍率與固定增量不同","N(t)=N0·2^(0.5t) 中 N(0)=N0，時間每增加 Δt，數量乘以 2^(0.5Δt)。倍增時令指數增加 1，解 Δt=2 天。"]],"steps":["t=0 時 N=2026，排除 C 的 0。","每天倍率為 2^0.5=√2，不是每天固定加 2026。","兩天倍率為 2^(0.5×2)=2。","因此每兩天加倍，選 D；這是題示模型，不是在預測真實平台。"],"reasons":["指數函數不具有固定的線性增量。","每天變化是乘 √2，不是固定加 2026。","2^0=1，所以初始為 2026。","時間增 2 天使指數增 1，數量乘 2。"],"transfer":{"prompt":"Q(t)=100·2^(t/3)，幾天加倍？Q(0) 為何？","answer":"3 天；100。","steps":["指數增加 1 需 t 增 3。","初始代 t=0。","100×2^0=100。"]},"numericChecks":[["2**(.5*2)",2]]},"needsOriginal":false},{"id":"115-math-c-12","year":115,"exam":"math-c","subjectName":"數學(C)","questionNo":12,"answer":"C","excerpt":"分解部分分式 = + ,其中A、B、C為實數,則 A+B+C =? x3−1 x−1 x2 +x+1","options":{"A":"– 2","B":"0","C":"2","D":"4"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"corruptedOcr":false,"originalPage":4,"groupId":null,"groupTitle":null,"passage":null,"sourceLabel":"115 年統測 · 數學(C)","lessonRoute":"/subjects/math-c/algebra","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/115_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"algebra","needsOriginal":false},{"id":"115-math-c-13","year":115,"exam":"math-c","subjectName":"數學(C)","questionNo":13,"answer":"B","excerpt":"某校羽球隊從 12 位選手中挑選 5 名,分別參加五場單打比賽。若 12 名選手中近況特別 良好的選手有 3 位,教練決定任意安排這 3 位選手分別在第一、三、五場出賽,另外 兩場由其餘選手任意安排出賽,則球隊選手出賽名單順序共有幾種?","options":{"A":"216","B":"432","C":"440","D":"448 數學"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"corruptedOcr":false,"originalPage":4,"groupId":null,"groupTitle":null,"passage":null,"sourceLabel":"115 年統測 · 數學(C)","lessonRoute":"/subjects/math-c/permutations-combinations","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/115_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"permutations-combinations","teaching":{"questionId":"115-math-c-13","routes":["/subjects/math-c/permutations-combinations"],"kind":"指定場次的限制排列","knowledge":[["場次有順序，選人後還要排列","3 位指定選手分配到第 1、3、5 場共有 3! 種。其餘 9 人中安排兩人到第 2、4 場，是 P(9,2)，不是只選不排的 C(9,2)。"]],"steps":["先處理限制最強的三個指定場次。","三位近況良好選手可作 3!=6 種分配。","剩下 9 人，第二場有 9 選擇、第四場有 8 選擇，共 72。","相乘 6×72=432，選 B；同一選手不重複出場。"],"reasons":["漏算部分場次順序或候選人數。","3!×9×8=432，兩個獨立階段相乘。","不是整數排列階段相乘的結果。","未依不重複與指定場次條件計數。"],"transfer":{"prompt":"5 人中選 2 人分任隊長與副隊長，共幾種？","answer":"20 種。","steps":["隊長 5 種選法。","副隊長不能同人，剩 4 種。","角色有別，5×4=20，不是 C(5,2)。"]},"numericChecks":[["6*9*8",432]]},"needsOriginal":false},{"id":"115-math-c-14","year":115,"exam":"math-c","subjectName":"數學(C)","questionNo":14,"answer":"B","excerpt":"已知ΔABC 中,∠A=60°,∠B=45°,且AC =4,試求ΔABC 的面積為多少? 4","options":{"A":"4+4√3/3","B":"6+2√3","C":"8+8√3/3","D":"12+4√3"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"corruptedOcr":false,"originalPage":5,"groupId":null,"groupTitle":null,"passage":null,"sourceLabel":"115 年統測 · 數學(C)","lessonRoute":"/subjects/math-c/trigonometry","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/115_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"trigonometry","teaching":{"questionId":"115-math-c-14","routes":["/subjects/math-c/trigonometry"],"kind":"兩角一邊的三角形面積","knowledge":[["先用正弦定理找第二邊","已知 A、B、b 時，a=b sinA/sinB。面積為 ab sinC/2，且 C=180°−A−B。邊名必須對應其對角。"]],"steps":["AC=b=4，A=60°、B=45°，故 C=75°。","a=4 sin60°/sin45°=2√6。","面積=(1/2)×4×2√6×sin75°。","代 sin75°=(√6+√2)/4，化簡為 6+2√3，選 B。"],"reasons":["未由正弦定理取得相鄰兩邊，不是本題面積。","正弦定理與面積公式代入後得到此值。","面積公式的邊與夾角配對錯誤。","12+4√3 是正解兩倍，漏掉面積的 1/2。"],"transfer":{"prompt":"兩邊長 4、6，夾角 30°，面積？","answer":"6。","steps":["確認 30° 為兩已知邊的夾角。","面積=4×6×sin30°/2。","得 6 平方單位。"]},"numericChecks":[[".5*4*(2*Math.sqrt(6))*Math.sin(75*Math.PI/180)",9.464101615137753]],"display":{"options":{"A":"4+4√3/3","B":"6+2√3","C":"8+8√3/3","D":"12+4√3"}}},"needsOriginal":false},{"id":"115-math-c-15","year":115,"exam":"math-c","subjectName":"數學(C)","questionNo":15,"answer":"D","excerpt":"若圖(二)中的實線是虛線 y =sinx 函數圖形經過平移與伸縮後的圖形,則圖(二)中的實 線是下列哪一個函數完整一個週期的圖形? 1 π","options":{"A":"y =sin( x− ) 2 6 π","B":"y =sin(2x− ) 7π 6 6 1 π π","C":"y =sin( x− ) 6 2 3 π","D":"y =sin(2x− ) 圖(二) 3 {\nx+ y≤2"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"corruptedOcr":false,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/115/math-c-q15.webp","originalPage":5,"groupId":null,"groupTitle":null,"passage":null,"sourceLabel":"115 年統測 · 數學(C)","lessonRoute":"/subjects/math-c/trigonometry","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/115_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"trigonometry","needsOriginal":false},{"id":"115-math-c-16","year":115,"exam":"math-c","subjectName":"數學(C)","questionNo":16,"answer":"B","excerpt":"已知實數x , y滿足二元一次聯立不等式 x≥0 ,若a = x− y,則a的範圍為何? y≥0","options":{"A":"a ≥ 2","B":"−2≤ a ≤ 2","C":"a ≤ 2","D":"a ≤ −2"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"corruptedOcr":false,"originalPage":5,"groupId":null,"groupTitle":null,"passage":null,"sourceLabel":"115 年統測 · 數學(C)","lessonRoute":"/subjects/math-c/linear-programming","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/115_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"linear-programming","needsOriginal":false},{"id":"115-math-c-17","year":115,"exam":"math-c","subjectName":"數學(C)","questionNo":17,"answer":"D","excerpt":"某監控攝影機的中心位於坐標平面上 ( 5 , 2 ) ,且監控範圍在半徑為 5 的圓內 (含邊界)。若某隻小老鼠從(–1,–2)沿著直線 x−y=1往(199,198)方向行走,則下列選項 何者正確?","options":{"A":"小老鼠會碰到攝影機","B":"攝影機不會偵測到小老鼠","C":"攝影機只有在一個點上偵測到小老鼠","D":"攝影機在一段範圍內會偵測到小老鼠"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"corruptedOcr":false,"originalPage":5,"groupId":null,"groupTitle":null,"passage":null,"sourceLabel":"115 年統測 · 數學(C)","lessonRoute":"/subjects/math-c/lines-circles","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/115_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"lines-circles","teaching":{"questionId":"115-math-c-17","routes":["/subjects/math-c/lines-circles"],"kind":"直線與圓相交及行進方向檢核","knowledge":[["點到線距離先判交會","圓心到直線距離 d 與半徑 r 比較：d<r 相交兩點、d=r 相切、d>r 相離。若題目是射線移動，還須確認交點在前進方向。"]],"steps":["圓心 O(5,2)、r=5；軌道線為 x−y−1=0。","圓心到線距離=|5−2−1|/√2=√2<5，所以直線穿過圓。","由起點 (−1,−2) 沿 (1,1) 前進，距圓心最近點為 (4,3)，確實在前進方向。","因此會在一段路徑內被偵測，選 D；圓心不在線上，所以不會直接碰到攝影機中心。"],"reasons":["圓心不在軌道線上，不能說會碰到中心。","d<r，軌道穿過監控圓。","只有 d=r 才是單一切點。","兩個交點間的線段位於監控範圍內，且在前進方向。"],"transfer":{"prompt":"圓心 (0,0)、半徑 3，直線 y=3 與圓如何相交？","answer":"相切於 (0,3)。","steps":["圓心到線距離為 3。","與半徑相等。","因此只有一個切點。"]},"numericChecks":[["Math.abs(5-2-1)/Math.sqrt(2)",1.4142135623730951]]},"needsOriginal":false},{"id":"115-math-c-18","year":115,"exam":"math-c","subjectName":"數學(C)","questionNo":18,"answer":"A","excerpt":"求不定積分 ∫x(x²−1)^115 dx。","options":{"A":"(x²−1)^116/232+C","B":"(x²−1)^116/116+C","C":"x(x²−1)^116/232+C","D":"(x²−1)^116/(116x)+C"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"corruptedOcr":false,"originalPage":6,"groupId":null,"groupTitle":null,"passage":null,"sourceLabel":"115 年統測 · 數學(C)","lessonRoute":"/subjects/math-c/integration","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/115_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"integration","teaching":{"questionId":"115-math-c-18","routes":["/subjects/math-c/integration"],"kind":"代換積分與微分回驗","knowledge":[["內函數微分只差常數","令 u=x²−1，du=2x dx，所以 x dx=du/2。把整個微分元素一起代換，積分後還要換回 x，最後微分驗證。"]],"steps":["原式 ∫x(x²−1)^115 dx，令 u=x²−1。","原式=(1/2)∫u^115 du。","積分得 u^116/(2×116)+C。","換回為 (x²−1)^116/232+C，選 A；微分乘回 116×2x/232=x。"],"reasons":["分母 232 同時包含積分指數 116 與內函數微分的 2。","少除以 2，微分會多出兩倍。","多出 x 因子，微分會產生額外項。","把 x 放到分母不是代換積分規則。"],"transfer":{"prompt":"求 ∫x(x²+1)³ dx，並用微分檢查。","answer":"(x²+1)⁴/8+C。","steps":["u=x²+1，x dx=du/2。","得到 u⁴/8+C。","微分為 (4/8)(x²+1)³·2x，還原原 integrand。"]},"numericChecks":[["116*2/232",1]],"display":{"excerpt":"求不定積分 ∫x(x²−1)^115 dx。","options":{"A":"(x²−1)^116/232+C","B":"(x²−1)^116/116+C","C":"x(x²−1)^116/232+C","D":"(x²−1)^116/(116x)+C"}}},"needsOriginal":false},{"id":"115-math-c-19","year":115,"exam":"math-c","subjectName":"數學(C)","questionNo":19,"answer":"B","excerpt":"已知橢圓具有下列光學性質:由其中一焦點 F 發射光線,經過橢圓鏡面一次反射,必然 x2 y2 通過另一焦點 F'。考慮橢圓 + =1與焦點 F(c,0)及F'(–c,0),且 c>0,當射手小華 25 9 在焦點 F朝橢圓上點 A(0,3)發出雷射光,光線直線前進至A點反射後直線前進通過焦點 F',然後在橢圓上另一點 B 反射,光線繼續前進回到 F 點並且不幸的擊中他自己。試問 這束雷射光在這段過程中所走的距離為何?","options":{"A":"15","B":"20","C":"25","D":"30"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"corruptedOcr":false,"originalPage":6,"groupId":null,"groupTitle":null,"passage":null,"sourceLabel":"115 年統測 · 數學(C)","lessonRoute":"/subjects/math-c/geometry","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/115_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"geometry","teaching":{"questionId":"115-math-c-19","routes":["/subjects/math-c/geometry"],"kind":"橢圓焦點距離和與反射路徑","knowledge":[["每次鏡面反射連結兩焦點","橢圓上任一點 P 滿足 PF+PF′=2a。反射路徑 F→A→F′→B→F 可分成兩組焦點距離和，各為 2a；不用先求 B 坐標。"]],"steps":["由 x²/25+y²/9=1 得長半軸 a=5。","第一段 F→A→F′，長度和為 2a=10。","第二段 F′→B→F，長度和亦為 10。","總長 20，選 B；反射性質可把未知 B 消去。"],"reasons":["只取部分路徑，未包括兩組完整焦點距離和。","2a+2a=4a=20。","25 是 a²，不是路徑長度。","把焦點往返組數多算了一組。"],"transfer":{"prompt":"橢圓 a=6，相同路徑 F→P→F′→Q→F 的總長為何？","answer":"24。","steps":["每組焦點距離和為 2a=12。","路徑包含兩組。","總長 12+12=24。"]},"numericChecks":[["4*5",20]]},"needsOriginal":false},{"id":"115-math-c-20","year":115,"exam":"math-c","subjectName":"數學(C)","questionNo":20,"answer":"D","excerpt":"林業及自然保育署利用空拍機拍攝一個堰塞湖。小茗想知道該堰塞湖的蓄水量,因此在 該照片上畫了一個平行四邊形,如圖 ( 三 ) 所示,經測量得知 AC 約 60 公尺 、 AB約 24 3公尺、∠BAC 約 120°,並得知該堰塞湖平均深度約 40 公尺。試問這個 堰塞湖的蓄水量最接近下列何者?","options":{"A":"30000立方公尺","B":"50000立方公尺","C":"70000立方公尺","D":"90000立方公尺 圖(三) 數學"},"requiresOfficialFigure":true,"corruptedOcr":false,"figureImage":"/exams/figures/115/math-c-q20.webp","originalPage":6,"groupId":null,"groupTitle":null,"passage":null,"sourceLabel":"115 年統測 · 數學(C)","lessonRoute":"/subjects/math-c/trigonometry","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/115_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"trigonometry","needsOriginal":false},{"id":"115-math-c-21","year":115,"exam":"math-c","subjectName":"數學(C)","questionNo":21,"answer":"A","excerpt":"在直角坐標平面上,極坐標表示法為r =sinθ+cosθ的圖形為何?","options":{"A":"圓","B":"正方形","C":"直線","D":"拋物線 xf(2)−2f(x)"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"corruptedOcr":false,"originalPage":7,"groupId":null,"groupTitle":null,"passage":null,"sourceLabel":"115 年統測 · 數學(C)","lessonRoute":"/subjects/math-c/trig-applications","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/115_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"trig-applications","teaching":{"questionId":"115-math-c-21","routes":["/subjects/math-c/trig-applications"],"kind":"極坐標轉直角坐標辨圖形","knowledge":[["消掉 r 的分母而不漏原點","x=r cosθ、y=r sinθ、r²=x²+y²。r=sinθ+cosθ 兩側乘 r，可得 r²=y+x；最後配方辨識圓心與半徑。"]],"steps":["r=sinθ+cosθ，乘以 r 得 r²=r sinθ+r cosθ。","代換為 x²+y²=x+y。","配方得 (x−1/2)²+(y−1/2)²=1/2。","這是圓，選 A；原點亦滿足此圓式，沒有因轉換而漏掉。"],"reasons":["配方為圓心 (1/2,1/2)、半徑 √2/2 的圓。","平方項配方形成圓，不是四條直邊。","保留 x²、y²，不是一次直線。","兩個平方項係數相同且同號，不是拋物線。"],"transfer":{"prompt":"r=2cosθ 轉直角坐標後是什麼圓？","answer":"(x−1)²+y²=1。","steps":["乘 r 得 r²=2r cosθ。","x²+y²=2x。","配方得圓心 (1,0)、半徑 1。"]}},"needsOriginal":false},{"id":"115-math-c-22","year":115,"exam":"math-c","subjectName":"數學(C)","questionNo":22,"answer":"C","excerpt":"多項式 f(x) 滿足 f(2)=f′(2)=115，求 lim(x→2) [x f(2)−2f(x)]/(x−2)。","options":{"A":"345","B":"115","C":"– 115","D":"– 345"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"corruptedOcr":false,"originalPage":7,"groupId":null,"groupTitle":null,"passage":null,"sourceLabel":"115 年統測 · 數學(C)","lessonRoute":"/subjects/math-c/calculus","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/115_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"calculus","teaching":{"questionId":"115-math-c-22","routes":["/subjects/math-c/calculus"],"kind":"把極限拆成導數定義","knowledge":[["先製造 f(x)−f(2)","分子 x f(2)−2f(x) 可改寫成 (x−2)f(2)−2[f(x)−f(2)]。再除以 x−2，才能辨認導數定義，避免直接代值成 0/0 就停止。"]],"steps":["已知 f(2)=f′(2)=115。","將極限寫為 f(2)−2·lim[f(x)−f(2)]/(x−2)。","後面的極限就是 f′(2)，因此值為 f(2)−2f′(2)。","115−230=−115，選 C；未使用任何未給的多項式係數。"],"reasons":["345 是把相減誤當相加。","漏掉 −2f′(2) 的項。","f(2)−2f′(2)=−115。","不符合分子正確拆解的符號與係數。"],"transfer":{"prompt":"f(1)=4、f′(1)=3，求 lim(x→1) [f(x)−4]/(x−1)。","answer":"3。","steps":["把 4 認作 f(1)。","式子恰為 f′(1) 定義。","因此等於 3，不需知道 f 的完整式子。"]},"numericChecks":[["115-2*115",-115]],"display":{"excerpt":"多項式 f(x) 滿足 f(2)=f′(2)=115，求 lim(x→2) [x f(2)−2f(x)]/(x−2)。"}},"needsOriginal":false},{"id":"115-math-c-23","year":115,"exam":"math-c","subjectName":"數學(C)","questionNo":23,"answer":"C","excerpt":"阿勇以平面向量設計戰爭攻略遊戲,設O ( 0 , 0 )為基地,列車與砲彈同時由O點出發及發 射。列車沿OA= ( 1 , 2 )方向的直線軌道前進,砲彈發射後第t秒的位置為( 3t , 4t )。若忽略 砲彈大小與其他環境因素,則砲彈發射後第2秒時,砲彈離列車軌道的距離為何?","options":{"A":"61","B":"2 2 4","C":"5 2","D":"5"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"corruptedOcr":false,"originalPage":7,"groupId":null,"groupTitle":null,"passage":null,"sourceLabel":"115 年統測 · 數學(C)","lessonRoute":"/subjects/math-c/vectors","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/115_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"vectors","needsOriginal":false},{"id":"115-math-c-24","year":115,"exam":"math-c","subjectName":"數學(C)","questionNo":24,"answer":"C","excerpt":"增廣矩陣 [a,1|11；1,b|5] 經列運算可化成 [1,0|2；0,1|3]，求 a+b。","options":{"A":"–2","B":"2","C":"5","D":"10 π"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"corruptedOcr":false,"originalPage":7,"groupId":null,"groupTitle":null,"passage":null,"sourceLabel":"115 年統測 · 數學(C)","lessonRoute":"/subjects/math-c/matrices","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/115_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"matrices","teaching":{"questionId":"115-math-c-24","routes":["/subjects/math-c/matrices"],"kind":"列運算保存方程組的解","knowledge":[["增廣矩陣最後一欄是常數","列運算不改變解集合。化為 [1,0|2]、[0,1|3] 表示未知數 x=2、y=3，再代回原方程 ax+y=11、x+by=5 求參數。"]],"steps":["由列化簡後矩陣讀出 x=2、y=3。","原第一式 ax+y=11，代入得 2a+3=11，所以 a=4。","原第二式 x+by=5，代入得 2+3b=5，所以 b=1。","a+b=5，選 C；不能把最後一欄也當成未知數係數。"],"reasons":["不是將解 (2,3) 代回後的參數和。","把解 x=2 直接當成 a+b。","a=4、b=1 共同滿足兩個原式。","未正確區分未知數解與原矩陣參數。"],"transfer":{"prompt":"已知方程 ax+y=10、x+by=8 的解是 (3,1)，求 a、b。","answer":"a=3、b=5。","steps":["3a+1=10，得 a=3。","3+b=8，得 b=5。","代回確認兩式皆成立。"]},"numericChecks":[["(11-3)/2+(5-2)/3",5]],"display":{"excerpt":"增廣矩陣 [a,1|11；1,b|5] 經列運算可化成 [1,0|2；0,1|3]，求 a+b。"}},"needsOriginal":false},{"id":"115-math-c-25","year":115,"exam":"math-c","subjectName":"數學(C)","questionNo":25,"answer":"A","excerpt":"試求函數 f(θ)= 3sin ( −θ)+cosθ的最大值為多少? 3","options":{"A":"7","B":"3+1","C":"3","D":"1"},"requiresOfficialFigure":false,"corruptedOcr":false,"originalPage":7,"groupId":null,"groupTitle":null,"passage":null,"sourceLabel":"115 年統測 · 數學(C)","lessonRoute":"/subjects/math-c/trig-applications","sourceUrl":"https://web1.tcte.edu.tw/EXAM/115_4y/downloader.php?obj=MTE1LTR5LTAwLW1jLnBkZg==","subject":"math-c","topic":"trig-applications","needsOriginal":false}]}
